# Welcome to the ERS Respiratory Channel

Access videos, podcasts, events, official guidelines and a range of learning materials all in one
place.

UPCOMING LIVE EVENT

# Coffee Talk: South Korea's COPD screening programme

Prof. Kwang Ha Yoo and Prof. Chin Kook Rhee (Konkuk University Medical Centre, Seoul, South Korea)
discuss South Korea's decision to include lung function testing in its national health screening
programme for the early detection of COPD.

[ Watch now ][213]
New episode out now

# The Institute: Respiratory People and Places - Lund

Dr Sheila Ramjug goes behind the scenes at Sk�ne University Hospital, Lund, Sweden - a centre that
is at the forefront of developing ex vivo lung perfusion to help improve the availability of lungs
for transplantation.

[ Watch the video ][214]
